---
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as ctxt CLI
    participant JobStore as Job Store
    participant Worker
    participant PluginPipeline as Plugin Pipeline<br/>(feed.fetch)
    participant RSSPlugin as RSS Feed Plugin
    participant Registry

    Note over User,Registry: Plugin-Defined Pipeline Flow<br/>(RSS Feed Example)

    User->>CLI: ctxt analyze --type feed<br/>"https://blog.example.com/rss"

    CLI->>JobStore: CREATE job<br/>pipeline='feed.fetch'<br/>payload={url: '...'}

    Worker->>JobStore: CLAIM job

    Worker->>PluginPipeline: Execute feed.fetch pipeline
    activate PluginPipeline

    PluginPipeline->>RSSPlugin: Task: FetchFeedDocument
    activate RSSPlugin
    RSSPlugin->>RSSPlugin: HTTP GET feed URL
    RSSPlugin-->>PluginPipeline: Raw RSS XML
    deactivate RSSPlugin

    PluginPipeline->>RSSPlugin: Task: ParseFeedMetadata
    activate RSSPlugin
    RSSPlugin->>RSSPlugin: Parse RSS XML
    RSSPlugin-->>PluginPipeline: Feed metadata:<br/>{title, link, description}
    deactivate RSSPlugin

    PluginPipeline->>RSSPlugin: Task: ParseFeedItems
    activate RSSPlugin
    RSSPlugin->>RSSPlugin: Extract items from feed
    RSSPlugin-->>PluginPipeline: Feed items: [item1, item2, ...]
    deactivate RSSPlugin

    PluginPipeline->>PluginPipeline: Create bookmark for feed<br/>(type: 'feed')

    PluginPipeline->>JobStore: Enqueue follow-up jobs<br/>for each feed item
    loop For each feed item
        PluginPipeline->>JobStore: CREATE job<br/>pipeline='feed.ingest_item'<br/>payload={item, parent_feed}
    end

    deactivate PluginPipeline

    PluginPipeline-->>Worker: Feed bookmark +<br/>N follow-up jobs

    Worker->>JobStore: WRITE feed bookmark
    Worker->>JobStore: MARK job completed

    Note over Worker,JobStore: Worker continues to process<br/>feed item jobs independently

    Worker->>JobStore: CLAIM next job<br/>(feed.ingest_item)

    Worker->>PluginPipeline: Execute feed.ingest_item
    activate PluginPipeline

    PluginPipeline->>RSSPlugin: Extract article content
    PluginPipeline->>Registry: Resolve mentions/tags
    PluginPipeline->>PluginPipeline: Create bookmark for article<br/>(linked to parent feed)

    deactivate PluginPipeline

    Worker->>JobStore: WRITE article bookmark
    Worker->>JobStore: MARK job completed

    Note over User,Registry: Plugin creates arbitrary pipelines<br/>without core modification
```
